        {
          "da_id": "ES2011b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.33",
          "quote": "That signal would go to a receiver which it would process it ,"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "ES2011b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.34",
          "quote": "and it would be output in the form of a buzzer or a light lighting up ."
        },
        {
          "da_id": "ES2011b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.35",
          "quote": "Um so my personal preferences for how to build the remote would probably be uh , battery for the energy source ,"
