        "text": "That signal would go to a receiver which it would process it ,",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.34",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011b",
        "text": "and it would be output in the form of a buzzer or a light lighting up .",
        "participant": "FEE042",
