        "da_id": "ES2011b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.35",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011b",
        "text": "Um so my personal preferences for how to build the remote would probably be uh , battery for the energy source ,",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
        "da_id": "ES2011b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.36",
        "meeting_id": "ES2011b",
        "text": "that way you wouldn't have to plug it in ,",
        "participant": "FEE042",
        "role": "ID"
      },
      {
